# Force LF line endings for all text files — in the repo and the working tree.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) get CRLF working-tree
# files, which conflict with Prettier's endOfLine:"lf": every `npm run format`
# then shows dozens of phantom-modified files, and `prettier --check` fails on a
# fresh checkout. Enforcing LF makes formatting deterministic across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf
